  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As an action, expend one link depth to increase your ally's attack bonus by one for one turn. You may expend addition link depth to extend the duration of this ability for an additional round per link depth. If your link is broken, the effect of Inspirational Mantle ends. Increase the bonus by one at 9th and 17th levels (up to a maximum of +3). At fifth level, also expand the critical hit range by the attack bonus granted by this feature.</p><p><a href=\"https://dnd-wiki.org/wiki/Empath_(5e_Class)\">Source: Empath by Axis, co-authored by Ghostwheel</a> (CC BY-SA 3.0). See the module's AUTOMATION.md for what is automated and how rules are interpreted.</p>",
